          "data": {
            "heading": "",
            "width": "narrow",
            "content": "<p>This policy explains how Heritage Homes Realty collects, uses and protects the personal information you share through this website.</p><h3>Information we collect</h3><p>When you send an enquiry or request a site visit we collect your name, phone number, email address and the details you provide, such as the property you are interested in.</p><h3>How we use it</h3><p>We use your details only to respond to your enquiry, arrange visits and share relevant properties. We do not sell your information. We may share it with the builder or owner of a property you ask about, only to arrange a visit.</p><h3>Your choices</h3><p>You can ask us to correct or delete your information at any time by writing to the email address on our contact page.</p>"
